<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- Android 12+ splash (spec UI §6.10): the user's Mochi (branding/icon/mochi_master.svg,
     same paths and colours) lands and bounces once, squash then stretch, and the note comes
     out, in 700 ms; MainActivity then fades the splash out (200 ms).
     VectorDrawable has no masks: the master's two masks (the band's gap around the face and
     the cups, the face's gap around the cups) are painted over in the background colour,
     which the splash sits on. 720 units = 288 dp: the art fits the 192 dp circle the system
     shows; its enclosing circle (253.25, 228.75), as in export.sh, is centred. -->
